  <regions type="content">
    <region left="0" top="0" width="466" height="83" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="466" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>micro:bit on a Quattrovelo bike steering arm<br /><br />Activates horn and brake lights from +10V with when there is a high G-force.<br /><br />A DG412 quad switch and a 2x3 pin header is soldered onto the micro:bit.</p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
